WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.566
This video shows how customers book appointments on their own, from a public

00:00:05.566 --> 00:00:09.464
page of your site, and how they move or cancel them with a link.

00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:14.420
It also shows the waitlist, which keeps customers in line for a time that is taken.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.364
Customers book at any hour, without a phone call.

00:00:22.364 --> 00:00:26.621
They see only the times that are really free, so the same person

00:00:26.621 --> 00:00:28.810
or room is never booked twice.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:32.233
Each appointment type has its own page.

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:36.272
A customer picks a day and a time, and receives a private link

00:00:36.272 --> 00:00:38.648
to move or cancel the appointment.

00:00:38.648 --> 00:00:40.133
Staff keep control:

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:42.450
a type can wait for confirmation.

00:00:46.652 --> 00:00:50.497
Online booking needs the Scheduling Self-Service feature.

00:00:50.497 --> 00:00:56.662
Open Tools, Features, search for Scheduling, and check that Scheduling Self-Service is enabled.

00:00:57.116 --> 00:01:00.668
Then each appointment type decides whether it is offered.

00:01:00.668 --> 00:01:02.528
Edit Physiotherapy session.

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:06.587
Customers can book it themselves puts it on a public page, and the

00:01:06.587 --> 00:01:10.026
Booking page address is the end of that page's address.

00:01:10.479 --> 00:01:13.984
The page is at slash book, slash physiotherapy.

00:01:13.984 --> 00:01:18.879
Add that address to your site's menu, or link to it from your pages.

00:01:23.086 --> 00:01:28.620
A customer opens the page, which shows the description, the length and the place.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:31.227
They choose a Day, then Show times.

00:01:31.227 --> 00:01:34.026
The times are in the site's time zone.

00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:39.496
They pick a time, and enter their Name, Email, Phone and any Notes.

00:01:43.885 --> 00:01:44.959
Choose Book.

00:01:44.959 --> 00:01:48.064
The customer lands on a Your appointment page.

00:01:48.064 --> 00:01:51.825
Its address is their manage link, so they should keep it.

00:01:52.276 --> 00:01:55.176
On that page they can move the appointment:

00:01:55.176 --> 00:01:57.838
choose another day and time, then Move.

00:01:57.838 --> 00:02:00.146
Cancel my appointment cancels it.

00:02:00.598 --> 00:02:05.183
Some appointment types wait for confirmation, such as the Ultrasound scan.

00:02:05.183 --> 00:02:07.533
The customer books it the same way:

00:02:07.533 --> 00:02:09.768
a day, a time, and their details.

00:02:10.218 --> 00:02:14.416
This time the page says the request has been received, and staff confirm

00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:16.838
it later, as the previous video showed.

00:02:21.034 --> 00:02:25.597
When a customer wants a time that is taken, add them to the waitlist.

00:02:25.597 --> 00:02:30.951
Open Calendars, Waitlist, choose the Appointment type, the first and last day they

00:02:30.951 --> 00:02:33.446
can come, and their name and email.

00:02:33.446 --> 00:02:34.784
Then choose Add.

00:02:35.237 --> 00:02:37.714
The customer is listed as Waiting.

00:02:37.714 --> 00:02:40.377
Remove takes a customer off the list.

00:02:40.835 --> 00:02:43.953
Now the customer who had the time cancels.

00:02:43.953 --> 00:02:47.655
Cancelling or moving an appointment frees its time.

00:02:48.106 --> 00:02:52.222
The customer who has waited longest, and can come on that day, is

00:02:52.222 --> 00:02:55.236
marked Notified, and a workflow can tell them.

00:02:59.436 --> 00:03:02.054
Scheduling doesn't send email by itself.

00:03:02.054 --> 00:03:06.436
To send the confirmation with the manage link, a workflow starts on the

00:03:06.436 --> 00:03:09.452
Appointment Confirmed event and sends an email.

00:03:09.452 --> 00:03:11.216
The next video builds it.

00:03:11.966 --> 00:03:16.756
The same way, a workflow on Waitlist Slot Available can email a waiting

00:03:16.756 --> 00:03:18.996
customer when a time frees up.

00:03:20.996 --> 00:03:25.695
Customers book, move and cancel on their own, the waitlist fills the gaps,

00:03:25.695 --> 00:03:27.869
and your staff stay in control.

00:03:27.869 --> 00:03:29.396
Thanks for watching.

